# Next.js architecture

- App Router only. Server Components are the default.
- Add `"use client"` only for state, events, IndexedDB, timers, or browser APIs.
- Keep `src/proxy.ts` as the request gate. Do not add `middleware.ts`.
- `params`, `searchParams`, and `cookies()` are async. Await them.
- Use `next/image` for remote exercise media and `next/font` for fonts already in the root layout.
- Do not pass the Supabase service role into Client Components.
- Do not add `--turbopack` to scripts; Next.js 16 already uses it for `next dev`.
